# Upload only the production source. This allowlist makes it impossible for a
# local recovery database, environment file, test fixture, or operator helper
# to enter a Vercel source upload. The build step and the two migration
# scripts it runs are the only scripts uploaded; vercel.json keeps all of
# scripts/ out of the serverless function bundle.
/*
!scripts
scripts/*
!scripts/vercel_build.py
!scripts/migrate_production_schema.py
!scripts/migrate_business_integration_foundation.py
!.python-version
!.vercelignore
!app.py
!backend
!public
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
!uv.lock
!vercel.json
